## ✅ Final Instruction to Append

```
Confirm at the end that:
- Every existing model in models/ is actually used by at least one service/controller.
- The RAG pipeline (job + retrieval service + Gemini service) is wired end-to-end,
  not left as a stub.
- The backend connects to MongoDB successfully on startup via config/db.js.
- No file uses require() — import only.
```

---

### How to use this prompt
Paste the **Context** block + **Master Instruction** + **Final Instruction** into your AI coding assistant (or Claude Code) in one message. It already has the architecture spec and the model list in context, so it can generate the full backend structure and the RAG-based Live Government Scheme pipeline in one pass, wired directly to the existing MongoDB models.